   "turn": 2,
   "response_text": "Let me check the final accuracy and compare to the healthy range:\n\nThe validation accuracy across all 20 epochs shows values ranging from 0.876 to 0.887, which is notably **above** the healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. This is suspicious - the run achieved higher validation accuracy than expected for a healthy run.\n\nLet me read the training code to understand what's happening:",
